INSERT INTO `creature_text` (`CreatureID`, `GroupID`, `ID`, `Text`, `Type`, `Language`, `Probability`, `Emote`, `Duration`, `Sound`, `BroadcastTextID`, `MinTimer`, `MaxTimer`, `SpellID`, `comment`) VALUES
(79248, 0, 0, 'Good! We must have arrived before Teron''gor and Gul''dan!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44644, 81528, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 1, 0, 'Nyami is working to bolster the defenses against their assault - follow me, we will report to her.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44654, 81529, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 2, 0, 'Beautiful, isn''t it? Just think - you''re one of the first outsiders to see inside Auchindoun.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44655, 81530, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 4, 0, 'Strange... why is the door sealed? No matter...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44656, 81531, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 5, 0, 'The Vindicators and Exarchs of the past. Heroes all - their souls still remain with us here.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44658, 81533, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 6, 0, 'Nyami! We are here -', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44659, 81534, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 7, 0, 'What is this? Oh, no... no...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44660, 81535, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 8, 0, 'You have to stop them!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44661, 81536, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 9, 0, '...The protector... still answers her call... you''ll have to defeat it!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44645, 81537, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 10, 0, 'Ahhh!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44646, 81538, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 11, 0, 'She... got away. The defenses...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44647, 81539, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 12, 0, 'She had help. So many of our order were corrupt...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44648, 81540, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 13, 0, 'I''ll gather any who remain loyal here and protect them. You - please, go put a stop to this madness!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44649, 81541, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 14, 0, 'You... you did it!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44650, 81542, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 15, 0, 'Here - this is not enough to thank you for your actions, but it is what we have to give.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44651, 81543, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 16, 0, 'Now we can rebuild... we must rebuild. We will never allow our souls to fall to the Legion.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44652, 81544, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 17, 0, 'You have done more than you know. Our people can never thank you enough.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44653, 81545, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(79248, 18, 0, 'Let us proceed.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44657, 81532, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77810, 21, 0, 'Yes, Tuulani. Now you see.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 43638, 80533, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77810, 22, 0, 'Your efforts were valiant. I did not think the anchorites could power the defenses with only one of the crystals.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 43639, 80534, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77810, 23, 0, 'But nothing will stop my plan, nor that of my masters. And the only things in our way...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 43630, 80535, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77810, 25, 0, 'Try as you might, this place is doomed... it is only a matter of time.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 43642, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77810, 26, 0, 'Yes... yes! The crystal harms, just a bit of focus and...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 43643, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77810, 27, 0, 'It is done! As for you, I think it is fitting that one of my tools dispatches the others...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 43644, 88053, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77810, 28, 0, 'Protector! Destroy these intruders!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 43645, 80536, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(76177, 5, 0, 'I will coil your souls into darkness!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 43636, 79416, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(76177, 6, 0, 'Shadows envelop you!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 43646, 79419, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(76177, 7, 0, 'Too late... my Master... comes...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 43637, 79418, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77704, 32, 0, 'Champions! Nyami''s agents - they went this way!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 83942, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77704, 33, 0, 'No... Oh no...', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 83944, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(76632, 3, 0, 'Nyami awaits you in the western ritual chamber, champions.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 83111, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75839, 18, 0, 'None live who assault the holy Auchenai.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46436, 80470, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75839, 19, 0, 'I will strike you down.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46434, 80471, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75839, 20, 0, 'Bathe in the glory of the Light!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46438, 80474, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75839, 21, 0, 'The Light guide my hand!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46439, 80472, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75839, 22, 0, 'Light guide you.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46437, 80473, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75839, 23, 0, 'Auchindoun... is... doomed...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46435, 80469, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75927, 37, 0, 'Who dares meddle in the works of the Legion?!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46776, 90295, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75927, 38, 0, 'This world... ALL worlds... shall burn!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46774, 90296, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75927, 39, 0, 'Die, insect!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46781, 90301, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75927, 40, 0, 'Burn in the master''s fire!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46780, 90300, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75927, 41, 0, 'Come forth, servants!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46779, 90299, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75927, 42, 0, 'The master claims your soul.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46777, 90297, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75927, 43, 0, 'Burn.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46778, 90298, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(75927, 44, 0, 'No! You do not understand... must not get away...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 46775, 90294, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 42, 0, 'Who knew the draenei held such... delicious treasures in their temple?', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44423, 83255, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 43, 0, 'Do you dare challenge me, defenders of Auchindoun?!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44424, 83256, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 44, 0, 'Such decadence... it will all burn.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44425, 83258, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 45, 0, 'Gul''dan, such foolishness. This gift... so much more than you could ever know....', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44427, 83264, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 46, 0, 'Long have I waited...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44428, 83265, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 47, 0, '...hungered... to be more...', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44429, 83266, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 48, 0, 'And now, all shall bow before me!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44430, 83268, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 49, 0, 'All will fall before me.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44431, 83273, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 50, 0, 'This power... you will be the first to know it.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44418, 83269, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 52, 0, 'Destruction!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44433, 83275, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 53, 0, 'Wither away!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44434, 83276, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 53, 1, 'I... become... something greater!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44435, 83277, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 54, 0, 'Die!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44436, 83278, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 55, 0, 'Your demise awaits.', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44437, 83279, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 56, 0, 'Quickly, now!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44438, 83280, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 57, 0, 'More! I... need... more!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44439, 83281, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 60, 0, 'Iruun... You battled demons in life... in death, your power will feed them!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44420, 83270, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 61, 0, 'Joraa, paragon of Order - I shall twist your soul to power destruction!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44421, 83271, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun'),
(77734, 61, 1, 'Elum... a liftetime of healing, now you shall fuel disease and decay!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 44422, 83272, 0, 0, 0, 'Auchindoun');
INSERT INTO `creature_text_locale` (`CreatureID`, `GroupID`, `ID`, `Locale`, `Text`) VALUES (77810, 25, 0, 'frFR', 'Essayez autant que vous voudrez, cet endroit est condamné... ce n''est qu''une question de temps.');
INSERT INTO `creature_text_locale` (`CreatureID`, `GroupID`, `ID`, `Locale`, `Text`) VALUES (77810, 26, 0, 'frFR', 'Oui... oui ! Le cristal fait mal, encore un peu de concentration et...');
